  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A plain text with no json kind is not navigable. At BUILD %x.port% is typed `item`\n(the shape is unknown, so the step is not refused — no guessing). At RUN, navigating\nthe text keeps the error (Ingi decision 401: a text whose kind can't navigate keeps\nthe error). The fix is to cast it (`as json`); see AsJson_ResolvesTypeUnknown.",
